10/extras/f27a4321a4b25a075dd543c271245b3a.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of\u00a0<i>Tidal Nexus</i>\u00a0pulses with activity\u2014and danger. Whether you're a new explorer or a seasoned captain, global events provide both opportunity and chaos:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kraken Boss Invasion</strong>\u00a0\u2013 A massive multi-phase raid where factions must unite to survive. The creature\u2019s arrival sounds the alarms and shifts map-wide power balances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battlezone Beacons</strong>\u00a0\u2013 A large-scale, faction-based PvP event where three factions battle to control four underwater beacons. Inspired by Domination-style gameplay, victory goes to the faction that holds the most zones over time. Expect nonstop skirmishes, tactical flanks, and tight zone defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Artifact Hunts</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Dynamic PvPvE events where clusters of alien artifacts spawn across the map in random locations. Each artifact activates on a timer and varies in tier and rarity. The number of artifacts and their value scale with global player activity. Competing players and factions must choose when to approach\u2014and when to fight for control.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These events rotate and evolve, reacting to both player behavior and world state. No two sessions play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/0990de088fa6db5b7023cedddd6e3b15.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/4b6e5605d0934a94c95346693d68949d.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=27 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your submarine is more than a vessel\u2014it\u2019s your identity. Dock at stations around the world to repair, trade, and fine-tune your ship. Unlock skins, swap modules, and adapt your build for speed, stealth, firepower, or support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters\u2014visually and tactically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/fd438c8c073e77271420099651fd5992.poster.avif?t=1747668811\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/fd438c8c073e77271420099651fd5992.webm?t=1747668811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/fd438c8c073e77271420099651fd5992.mp4?t=1747668811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/3dfdaf805cee60f5b243f5eb4f1a8e3f.poster.avif?t=1747668811\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/3dfdaf805cee60f5b243f5eb4f1a8e3f.webm?t=1747668811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/3dfdaf805cee60f5b243f5eb4f1a8e3f.mp4?t=1747668811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/fa2f8d4747b83416477fa2ff70f45524.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=29 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large-scale, persistent underwater MMO world with PvP, PvE, exploration, and trade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formal clan war system with structured conflict periods and shared rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep submarine customization with skins, modules, and performance tuning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional PvP flagging that introduces high-risk, high-reward open combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic world events: Kraken raids, battlezone control points, artifact hunts, and roaming minibosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission system with main quests, daily tasks, and randomized PvE, PvP, and trade objectives</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/f7f4054b4a1d67608ea963a465d5be2b.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/cd934e0fd39a6820a4e68bf5221ebd79.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/3876c0f8e13a8053f801b3598cd42c04.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937310/extras/9e82e091eea2b92b26744bc6eb0ca3a1.avif?t=1747668811\" data-has-big width=800 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tidal Nexus Online</i>\u00a0is currently in alpha. We\u2019re a small, dedicated team building the underwater MMO